      "claim": "Accountability requires us to audit the reasoning path, as the outcome alone is insufficient to guarantee safety.",
      "targets": ["AN-10"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "We must mandate structural interpretability as a prerequisite for deployment in safety-critical sectors.",
      "targets": ["AN-14"]
